      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1957 Joseph Vlasic bought a pickle plant on Blacks Corners Road, and two years later founded Vlasic Foods, making Imlay City the birthplace of Vlasic pickle brand.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
