      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Imlay_City%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Imlay City was named after William Imlay, a land investor who helped organize the township in 1850, and the village incorporated in 1871.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
